# Competitive chart — <client>

Written by `market-analyst` in Loop 1c. Read by the conductor at 1e, shown to the
client at Gate B1 as the competitor overlay, and read by every `section-designer` in
Loop 2a.

This chart is the fence (`§3`). Whatever five of six competitors look like is what this
site does not look like. A board that could sit in this chart unnoticed has failed.

Evidence, not opinion. Verbatim, not paraphrase. Sample the hexes, do not describe
them. Screenshots in `runs/<slug>/competitors/`.

